---
layout: base.njk
title: "Research · Mudun Lab"
description: "Two-layer research on Jordan's cities: a plain-language brief on top, the full study underneath. Mobility, walkability, public space, housing, transit."
---
{% import "entry-card.njk" as cardlib %}
  <section class="view active" id="view-research">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2 data-en="Research on Jordan's cities" data-ar="أبحاثٌ عن مدن الأردن"></h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem"
           data-en="Each study comes in two layers: a short brief anyone can read, and the full study (PDF) for anyone who wants the methods and data."
           data-ar="لكلّ دراسة طبقتان: ملخّصٌ قصير يستطيع أيّ شخص قراءته، والدراسة الكاملة (PDF) لمن يريد المنهجية والبيانات."></p>
      </div>


      {# Only show filters for categories that actually have a piece, and only when there's more than one #}
      {% set used = [] %}
      {% for e in collections.research %}{% if e.data.category not in used %}{% set used = (used.push(e.data.category), used) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% if used.length > 1 %}
      <div class="filters" data-filter-group aria-label="Categories">
        <button class="chip active" data-filter="all" data-en="All" data-ar="الكل"></button>
        {% for key, c in categories.research %}{% if key in used %}<button class="chip" data-filter="{{ key }}" data-en="{{ c.en }}" data-ar="{{ c.ar }}"></button>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="entries">
{% for entry in collections.research %}{{ cardlib.card(entry, "research", categories) }}{% endfor %}
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:26px;color:var(--asphalt-soft);max-width:60ch"
         data-en="More research is on the way. If you study cities in Jordan, we'd like to read your work."
         data-ar="المزيد من الأبحاث في الطريق. إن كنت تدرس مدن الأردن، يسعدنا أن نقرأ عملك."></p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/publish/" style="margin-top:6px" data-en="Publish your research" data-ar="انشُر بحثك"></a>
    </div>
  </section>
